 "brief": "Israeli occupation authorities will hold sessions Tuesday to extend administrative detention orders for 30 Palestinian prisoners, the Shehab Wire reported. Administrative detention allows indefinite imprisonment without trial or formal charges.\n\nThe hearings represent part of a broader pattern of using administrative detention as a tool to hold Palestinians in custody. Israel has faced international criticism over the practice, which human rights organizations say violates due process rights.",
